[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2888635355","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101792#issuecomment-2888635355","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101792","id":2888635355,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sLRPb","user":{"login":"lyuma","id":39946030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTQ2MDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39946030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma","html_url":"https://github.com/lyuma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-17T23:25:48Z","updated_at":"2025-05-17T23:25:48Z","body":"Discussed in a call with Saracen and Tokage and iFire, and we also reviewed the code, so we agree to merge this.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2888635355/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2888646618","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101792#issuecomment-2888646618","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101792","id":2888646618,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sLT_a","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-18T00:02:54Z","updated_at":"2025-05-18T00:22:31Z","body":"Supplemental:\r\n\r\nThis changing affects the case where there is a TimeScale downstream of the OneShot.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0375458b-2a8a-4683-91ce-00e66240bcc9)\r\n\r\nUntil now, the OneShot's fade time was scaled by the downstream (left) TimeScale. This means that **NodeOneShot had the problem of inverting the parent-child / master-slave relationship**.\r\n\r\nTransition and StateMachine do not have this problem.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fa3e0253-7f9a-47ed-84f5-1a479ce8d24a)\r\n\r\nThis means that only OneShot was inconsistent, which is basically the change that should have been made as the bugfix.\r\n\r\nIn the case of the TimeScale is placed downstream of the OneShot, there are several possible ways to preserve the old behavior.\r\n\r\n- Explicitly divide the fade time by the downstream TimeScale\r\n- Change the insertion position of the TimeScale to upstream (right) of the OneShot\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ddd7f470-5b24-47ac-8246-fbc54bfd9b62)\r\n\r\n> If someone has problems with this change that can't be addressed by tweaking the fadein/fadeout time, then they can file a new issue and we can consider adding a setting to bring back the old behavior.\r\n\r\nIf there are too many past projects that this would affect, we would consider this, but if this is to be made permanently optional, we need to consider whether to include a master-slave inversion in Transition and StateMachine as well, but at least we should not do that. If it were to be made optional, it would be an option with the deprecated flag like `bool legacy_mode`.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2888646618/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2890957564","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101792#issuecomment-2890957564","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101792","id":2890957564,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sUIL8","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-19T13:04:42Z","updated_at":"2025-05-19T13:04:42Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2890957564/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]